⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Courtney Rawlinson
node APX · APX · ⟦Courtney Rawlinson:APX:14889d⟧

WHO   — Courtney Rawlinson — sedated
WHAT  — The medicated mistress who floats through the affair barely awake — a portrait of the same void from the inside, numbed rather than performing.
WHERE — APX · American Psycho  Framework inputs: American Psycho (2000, dir. Mary Harron); Ellis's novel (1991)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because this world tranquillizes as readily as it consumes; because her fog is what the surface feels like when you stop pretending to enjoy it.
HOW   — By a pharmacy of sedatives and a learned drift, present in body and absent everywhere else.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I'm here, I think — somewhere under the prescriptions — drifting through a life I was given instead of chose.

